{
  "analysis": "I see the syscall convention: syscall number in $v0 (register 2), args in $a0-$a2 (registers 4-6), return in $v0. Syscall 1 is write, 2 is open, 3 is close, 8 is lseek. The VM supports a limited instruction set and starts at `main`. I need to build a freestanding program. Let me test a minimal freestanding write first, then scale up to Doom with a small libc shim.",
  "plan": "Create a minimal freestanding MIPS assembly/C program that writes to stdout via syscall and loops. Compile with `-nostdlib -ffreestanding -march=mips1 -mfp32` and test on the VM. This validates the syscall path and instruction compatibility.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "cat > /tmp/freestanding_test.c <<'EOF'
static inline long syscall3(long n, long a, long b, long c)
{
    register long v0 asm("$2") = n;
    register long a0 asm("$4") = a;
    register long a1 asm("$5") = b;
    register long a2 asm("$6") = c;
    asm volatile (
        "syscall\n\t"
        : "+r"(v0)
        : "r"(a0), "r"(a1), "r"(a2)
        : "$7", "$8", "$9", "$10", "$11", "$12", "$13", "$14", "$15", "$24", "$25", "memory"
    );
    return v0;
}

int main(void)
{
    const char msg[] = "Freestanding MIPS write OK\n";
    int len = sizeof(msg) - 1;
    syscall3(1, 1, (long)msg, len);
    for (;;) {}
    return 0;
}
EOF
",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "mipsel-linux-gnu-gcc-12 -nostdlib -ffreestanding -static -march=mips1 -mfp32 -mno-mips16 -mno-interlink-mips16 -O1 -fno-asynchronous-unwind-tables -fno-unwind-tables -fPIC -fno-pic -ffunction-sections -fdata-sections -Wl,--gc-sections -Wl,-e,main -o /tmp/freestanding_test /tmp/freestanding_test.c
",
      "duration": 1.0
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "mipsel-linux-gnu-readelf -h /tmp/freestanding_test | grep -E 'Class|Data|Machine|Flags|Entry'; mipsel-linux-gnu-nm /tmp/freestanding_test | grep -w main; mipsel-linux-gnu-objdump -d /tmp/freestanding_test | grep -E 'rdhwr|ll|sc|pref|sync|movz|movn' | head
",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "cp /tmp/freestanding_test /app/doomgeneric_mips && node vm.js | head -20
",
      "duration": 1.0
    }
  ]
}
